---
const siteTitle = "La Familia – Travel Planning";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{siteTitle}</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        --text: #1f2933;
        --muted: #5b6570;
        --border: #d7dce1;
        --surface: #ffffff;
        --accent: #2f5d7c;
        --background: #f6f7f9;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Inter", "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        color: var(--text);
        background: var(--background);
      }

      main {
        max-width: 960px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 64px 24px 104px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 48px;
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3 {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 2.6rem;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      h2 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      p {
        margin: 0 0 18px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .section {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 32px 36px;
      }

      .section-header {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .subtitle {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        max-width: 640px;
      }

      .identity {
        display: grid;
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .context {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        max-width: 720px;
      }


      .travel-ideas {
        display: grid;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .idea-card {
        display: grid;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
        background: #fbfbfc;
      }

      .idea-card:hover,
      .idea-card:focus {
        border-color: var(--accent);
      }

      .idea-title {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .idea-meta {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .travel-ideas {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <section class="section identity">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h1>{siteTitle}</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">
            Shared workspace for exploring, comparing, and documenting travel options before any
            commitments are made.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="context">
          This private planning archive supports iterative comparison for our family and trusted
          travel advisors, consolidating notes and options as decisions are refined.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Family of five: two parents and three teenagers (ages 15, 18, 19). Trips are planned
          together and reviewed against shared priorities and constraints.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>How we use this site</h2>
        <p>
          Planning is a staged process. Ideas are collected, compared, and refined over multiple
          rounds. Not every option becomes a trip, and incomplete notes are expected while research
          is still in progress.
        </p>
        <p>
          Each idea is treated as a working file with assumptions, alternatives, and open questions
          until a final decision is made.
        </p>
        <p>
          Baseline preferences and theme-specific criteria live in the
          <a href="preferences/baseline/">baseline reference</a> and the
          <a href="preferences/themes/summer-rainforest-snorkeling/">active themes</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Planning frameworks</h2>
        <div class="travel-ideas">
          <a class="idea-card" href="preferences/baseline/">
            <span class="idea-title">Travel preferences – baseline</span>
            <span class="idea-meta">
              General criteria and constraints used to evaluate travel ideas.
            </span>
            <span class="idea-meta">Reference</span>
          </a>
          <a class="idea-card" href="preferences/themes/summer-rainforest-snorkeling/">
            <span class="idea-title">Theme: Summer rainforest + snorkeling</span>
            <span class="idea-meta">Context-specific criteria for that theme.</span>
            <span class="idea-meta">Active</span>
          </a>
          <a class="idea-card" href="preferences/themes/ski-trip/">
            <span class="idea-title">Theme: Ski trip</span>
            <span class="idea-meta">Context-specific planning context for winter travel.</span>
            <span class="idea-meta">Draft</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Travel ideas</h2>
        <div class="travel-ideas">
          <a class="idea-card" href="trips/bali/">
            <span class="idea-title">Bali</span>
            <span class="idea-meta">Status: active research • Focus: routing + lodging scenarios</span>
          </a>
          <a class="idea-card" href="trips/portugal/">
            <span class="idea-title">Portugal</span>
            <span class="idea-meta">Status: placeholder • Focus: regional options under review</span>
          </a>
          <a class="idea-card" href="trips/japan/">
            <span class="idea-title">Japan</span>
            <span class="idea-meta">Status: placeholder • Focus: season timing and transit costs</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
